Text Notes 11000 13650 0    69   ~ 14
A Note To SMD Users\nAll the resistors can be 1%. The cost of 1%\nversus 5% is minimal. Most parts can be 0603,\n0805 or 1206 whatever you are comfortable\nworking with. You need 2512 resistors for the\nshunts. The 2.2uF/100V should be 100V 1210 size.
Text Notes 13900 13750 0    69   ~ 14
The value of the meter\noutput resistor should\nbe 50 ohms x number\nof output stages. For\nexample, with four\noutput stages use\n200 ohm resistors.
Text Notes 11100 14400 0    69   ~ 14
http://www.eevblog.com/forum/projects/dynamic-electronic-load-project/
