A Note To Non-KiCad Users\nKiCad allows the selection of component\nfootprints, regardless of their schematic\nsymbol. 01x03 Connectors, labeled as\n"Wire Pads," are used here, to represent\nthe selection of Wire Pads, on the PCB\nboard. This method enables the use of\nseparate Control and MOSFET PCB boards.\nHowever, these connections should be hard\nwired. Because of high power draws,\nconnectors should not be used, to connect\nboards, to MOSFETs. If a single,\nControl-MOSFET board is used, remove these\npads, from the circuit. 
